      "widgets_values": [
        "<Video 1> and <Picture 1> are grounding views of the same woman; <Audio 1> and <Audio 2> are the same source voice. integrated_multimodal_description: One continuous static medium close-up shot of a young adult Chinese woman sitting by a window in a quiet cafe. She has shoulder-length dark hair and wears a plain blue shirt. Soft natural daylight, realistic skin, stable face and hair, neutral background, no colorful flashing lights. At 1.0 seconds she looks directly at the camera and smiles gently. Between 1.0 and 3.5 seconds she says exactly once, clearly and naturally: <d>[Chinese]你好，今天天气不错。</d> After speaking she closes her lips and gives one small nod. The camera does not cut. overall_soundscape: A clear normal female conversational voice, faint quiet room ambience, no other voices, no repeated dialogue, no singing. non_diegetic_music: None.",
